Mr. Bhatia!

1343
01:55:31.708 --> 01:55:33.167
Bless you, dear.

1344
01:55:33.750 --> 01:55:34.833
Hey.

1345
01:55:39.083 --> 01:55:40.083
Come.

1346
01:55:42.417 --> 01:55:43.417
Sit!

1347
01:55:45.958 --> 01:55:47.042
Sit!

1348
01:55:50.333 --> 01:55:52.000
- Make it tight.
- Yes, sir.

1349
01:55:57.667 --> 01:55:59.000
Open your mouth.

1350
01:56:06.958 --> 01:56:09.417
Look! Do you see something there?

1351
01:56:26.833 --> 01:56:29.708
There are trucks
approaching from the hillock!

1352
01:56:34.167 --> 01:56:37.667
Landa is in the execution room.
His walkie-talkie is off.

1353
01:57:04.875 --> 01:57:06.167
Long live revolution!

1354
01:57:07.792 --> 01:57:09.042
Bad omen. Close the Soul Door.

1355
01:57:09.125 --> 01:57:11.875
Yes, Father. Let me at least
see what happened.

1356
01:57:11.958 --> 01:57:14.500
Alert! Prison breach…

1357
01:57:16.042 --> 01:57:18.875
Alert! Prison breach!

1358
01:57:20.167 --> 01:57:22.667
