Get the boys and come to admin block.</i>

1362
01:57:34.542 --> 01:57:36.667
<i>I'll meet you there.</i>

1363
01:57:38.708 --> 01:57:42.167
<i>Three unmanned trucks crashed
into the backup generators.</i>

1364
01:57:46.250 --> 01:57:48.500
