1379
01:58:54.333 --> 01:58:56.000
<i>Riots have broken out in all blocks!</i>

1380
01:58:56.083 --> 01:58:58.208
<i>We need backup from the mainland.</i>

1381
01:58:58.875 --> 01:59:02.333
<i>OIC Landa, respond!
The situation is totally out of control.</i>

1382
01:59:04.458 --> 01:59:07.125
<i>Prisoners have escaped to the city.</i>

1383
01:59:07.250 --> 01:59:09.167
<i>OIC Landa, respond!</i>

1384
01:59:09.417 --> 01:59:12.583
