1406
02:07:03.625 --> 02:07:09.375
<i>Having travelled the world
Bulleh Shah said</i>

1407
02:07:09.500 --> 02:07:14.583
<i>"The ones who risk their lives stay alive"</i>

1408
02:07:14.667 --> 02:07:17.250
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1409
02:07:17.542 --> 02:07:20.250
<i>Do not lose courage</i>

1410
02:07:20.500 --> 02:07:23.208
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1411
02:07:23.375 --> 02:07:26.417
<i>This is your turn</i>

1412
02:07:26.708 --> 02:07:28.292
<i>Why fear?</i>

1413
02:07:28.417 --> 02:07:31.958
<i>If you are punished
For every breath you take</i>

1414
02:07:32.167 --> 02:07:34.833
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1415
02:07:35.125 --> 02:07:38.000
<i>Do not lose courage</i>

1416
02:07:42.250 --> 02:07:44.708
<i>Jigra!</i>

1417
02:07:46.958 --> 02:07:49.542
<i>I'm always by your side</i>

1418
02:07:49.792 --> 02:07:54.167
<i>Jigra!</i>

1419
02:07:54.417 --> 02:07:57.625
<i>Jigra!</i>

1420
02:07:59.958 --> 02:08:03.125
<i>Do not lose courage</i>

1421
02:08:18.708 --> 02:08:23.208
<i>If we do not grab our share of love</i>

1422
02:08:24.583 --> 02:08:28.792
<i>The poor world will call you weak</i>

1423
02:08:29.375 --> 02:08:32.875
Jump onto the roof! Go!

1424
02:08:40.000 --> 02:08:45.292
<i>Having travelled the world,
Bulleh Shah said</i>

1425
02:08:45.833 --> 02:08:51.000
<i>"Jump off the cliff and you will fly"</i>

1426
02:08:51.500 --> 02:08:53.292
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1427
02:08:53.875 --> 02:08:56.333
<i>Do not lose courage</i>

1428
02:08:56.875 --> 02:08:58.958
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1429
02:08:59.833 --> 02:09:02.958
<i>Be prepared for the fight</i>

1430
02:09:03.042 --> 02:09:04.417
<i>Challenge the enemy</i>

1431
02:09:04.500 --> 02:09:08.375
<i>Let no one take your turn</i>

1432
02:09:08.458 --> 02:09:11.125
<i>Jigra! O Jigra!</i>

1433
02:09:11.208 --> 02:09:12.042
- Sis!
- Run!

1434
02:09:12.125 --> 02:09:15.208
- Run!
- Let's go, come!

1435
02:09:16.833 --> 02:09:20.125
- Did his sister do all this?
- Who knows!

1436
02:09:21.042 --> 02:09:22.750
Over here…

1437
02:09:22.833 --> 02:09:24.417
Is this your sister's doing?

1438
02:09:24.500 --> 02:09:27.333
She is in a bad mood.
Don't ask now. Just run!

1439
02:09:31.667 --> 02:09:34.583
Go straight! Open the door.

1440
02:09:36.167 --> 02:09:38.167
- Open it.
- It won't open.

1441
02:09:41.708 --> 02:09:43.833
Come in, Mr. Bhatia.

1442
02:09:45.125 --> 02:09:46.125
Mr. Bhatia, come in!

1443
02:09:54.750 --> 02:09:56.583
Open it!

1444
02:09:57.958 --> 02:10:02.417
- <i>Friendship is faith to me…</i>
- Move! Move!

1445
02:10:06.458 --> 02:10:10.958
<i>Friendship is faith to me
My friend is my life…</i>

1446
02:10:11.542 --> 02:10:13.208
- Let's go.
- Papa?

1447
02:10:15.750 --> 02:10:17.167
Stop!

1448
02:10:32.083 --> 02:10:33.417
Sis!

1449
02:10:34.042 --> 02:10:36.125
Sis! Talk to me.

1450
02:10:36.208 --> 02:10:38.292
- Are you my dad's friend?
- Down!

1451
02:10:38.375 --> 02:10:40.250
- Let me greet my dad.
- Don't move.

1452
02:10:40.333 --> 02:10:41.417
- Sis!
- Yes?

1453
02:10:41.542 --> 02:10:42.583
What's going on?

1454
02:10:43.167 --> 02:10:45.708
Let's get home first.
I'll explain everything.

1455
02:10:53.667 --> 02:10:55.500
Mr. Bhatia, what a playlist!

1456
02:10:55.750 --> 02:10:56.917
Thank you.

1457
02:10:57.667 --> 02:10:59.167
Bachchan forever!

1458
02:11:10.667 --> 02:11:12.583
Everyone, stay still.

1459
02:11:16.000 --> 02:11:20.000
All under control, okay?
Don't move! Stay down.

1460
02:11:22.458 --> 02:11:26.375
<i>Friendship has bathed us in divine light</i>

1461
02:11:27.750 --> 02:11:30.500
<i>Friendship has bathed us in divine light</i>

1462
02:11:30.583 --> 02:11:34.833
<i>Friendship is life itself…</i>

1463
02:12:16.000 --> 02:12:19.625
The police will chase us till the docks.

1464
02:12:20.583 --> 02:12:23.917
I'll distract them so you can get there.

1465
02:12:24.792 --> 02:12:27.458
- Mr. Bhatia...
- No time to argue, Satya.

1466
02:12:44.625 --> 02:12:48.333
Our backup car is close.

1467
02:12:52.625 --> 02:12:53.917
Can I do something?

1468
02:12:55.625 --> 02:12:59.750
Tony…

1469
02:13:00.375 --> 02:13:01.500
Tony.

1470
02:13:03.333 --> 02:13:06.917
Tony, be careful. Come forward.

1471
02:13:11.708 --> 02:13:12.917
Papa.

1472
02:13:15.958 --> 02:13:17.417
Tony.

1473
02:13:18.958 --> 02:13:21.708
Son, I've lived my life.

1474
02:13:22.583 --> 02:13:26.000
Now you must enjoy a long life, too.

1475
02:13:26.750 --> 02:13:28.542
For my sake.

1476
02:13:29.625 --> 02:13:32.000
Papa, I'm not going anywhere without you.

1477
02:13:40.500 --> 02:13:42.000
Papa, I won't go.

1478
02:13:43.417 --> 02:13:46.083
Go! Just go.

1479
02:13:46.750 --> 02:13:48.875
- Go.
- Papa, no.

1480
02:13:49.125 --> 02:13:51.625
Ankur, handle Tony.

1481
02:13:52.208 --> 02:13:55.208
Fetch the bags and the water can
from under the seat.

1482
02:13:55.292 --> 02:13:57.875
Take good care of him.
We have to stop here.

1483
02:13:59.500 --> 02:14:00.625
Brake! Brake!

1484
02:14:06.625 --> 02:14:09.417
Move! Hurry.

1485
02:14:10.000 --> 02:14:11.625
I'll keep Tony safe.

1486
02:14:13.500 --> 02:14:14.542
I know.

1487
02:14:14.625 --> 02:14:17.833
Idiot! Leave him. Follow me.

1488
02:14:18.833 --> 02:14:20.833
- Let's go.
- Satya!

1489
02:14:24.167 --> 02:14:25.500
That was fun!

1490
02:14:26.458 --> 02:14:27.875
Thank you.

1491
02:14:46.208 --> 02:14:47.833
Get out of the car!

1492
02:14:49.083 --> 02:14:53.292
Get down or we'll shoot!

1493
